<title>USA: Grupo Sidek 1996 yr net loss PS2.43 bln.</title>
<headline>Grupo Sidek 1996 yr net loss PS2.43 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In million pesos)</p>
<p>					 For year ended December 31,</p>
<p>						1996	   1995</p>
<p>Revenues			  Ps.    4,322	   4,954</p>
<p>Profit (loss) from operations     (1,849)	    596</p>
<p>Net loss				  (2,428)	 (2,404)</p>
<p>NOTES: As a result of losses incurred by Sidek during the twelve months ended December 31, 1996, it had as of that date negative majority stockholders' equity and accordingly, under Mexican law any interested party can request the liquidation of Sidek through judicial proceedings in Mexico.  As of December 31, 1996, the company's Grupo Situr SA de CV unit also had negative majority stockholders' equity and accordingly, under Mexican law any interested party can request the liquidation of Situr through judicial proceedings in Mexico.</p>
<p>Grupo Sidek SA de CV</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
